          "settings": {
            "heading": "🌙 <strong>Reflective No Pull Dog Harness – Comfort and Control in One</strong>",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text_HeCUiU": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Tired of your dog dragging you down the street? Our <strong>Reflective No Pull Dog Harness</strong> is the answer. With its <strong>front-clip design</strong>, it gently discourages pulling and offers better steering without choking your pet.</p><p>Crafted with <strong>breathable mesh</strong>, <strong>lightweight materials</strong>, and <strong>high-visibility reflective strips</strong>, this harness is perfect for early morning or late-night adventures. Keep your dog safe, seen, and stylish with this <strong>must-have walking gear</strong>.</p>"
          }
        }
