          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Make every walk with your pup stress-free and secure with our <strong>No Pull Reflective Dog Harness</strong>. Designed to reduce pulling and improve control, this harness features <strong>adjustable straps</strong>, a <strong>padded chest plate</strong>, and <strong>reflective stitching</strong> for high visibility during nighttime strolls.</p><p>Whether you're training a new pup or walking a seasoned companion, this <strong>durable dog harness</strong> ensures comfort and safety. Say goodbye to tugging and hello to relaxed, enjoyable walks with your <strong>no pull solution</strong>.</p>",
